  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674432",
      "title": "Analyzing the Created Project",
      "lectureOrder": 11,
      "videoOrder": 8,
      "sourceHash": "c5ddb42fc4d16eb92e66d76a7642cedcc51d82f76ffccd6cba21bf672c0bff30",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "So what do we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "in this brand new remix project?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "Well, we got a bunch of configuration files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "on the root level here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 11.7,
          "en": "A remix configuration file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.7,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "where we can set various remix settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.34,
          "en": "And I'll get back to some of these settings later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "in the course once we prepare our application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "for deployment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "Right now, the default settings are fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 26.25,
          "en": "We then get the package.json file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.25,
          "end": 28.62,
          "en": "which contains a list of all the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.62,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "that are installed into this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "Right now, as you can see, it's basically a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "of remix dependencies and of course react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 39,
          "en": "since we're still building a react app here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "Just a full stack react app of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 44.88,
          "en": "And then we get various scripts which we can execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.88,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "to, for example, build this project for production,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "to start the production server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "or very important for us for the majority of this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 55.71,
          "en": "this dev script here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.71,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "which allows us to start a development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "which allows us to preview the app whilst we're building it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 66.06,
          "en": "We then get a jsconfig file and a eslint config file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.06,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "with further settings for the code editor we're using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 71.78999999999999,
          "en": "and for how this project is being built.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.78999999999999,
          "end": 74.94,
          "en": "But all the default settings are fine here for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 76.74,
          "en": "and they offer its nowadays folders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.74,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "which are interesting to us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 79.92,
          "en": "Now, node modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "as always contains all the dependencies of this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "and you should not edit anything in that folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 87.33,
          "en": "You can also delete this folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.33,
          "end": 91.28999999999999,
          "en": "and always bring it back by running NPM install, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "This will then install all the dependencies listed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 97.293,
          "en": "in package.json and recreate node modules with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 99.96000000000001,
          "en": "But the public and app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 102.303,
          "en": "these are the interesting folders for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "Now, the public folder simply contains",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 108.12,
          "en": "any static assets your application might require.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108.12,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "For example, any images you wanna serve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 113.673,
          "en": "in your application could be put into this public folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 117.24000000000001,
          "en": "But it's the app folder that's most interesting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "because you'll spend the vast majority",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "of your time in that folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 125.07,
          "en": "because in that folder you define your react components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.07,
          "end": 129.45,
          "en": "you want to use and your routes your pages you wanna support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.45,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "in this full stack application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "so that users can, for example, visit my domain.com/nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "and my domain.com/news or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "That will be defined here in this routes sub folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 145.14,
          "en": "And that's something I will of course come back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.14,
          "end": 147.57,
          "en": "to later in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 149.34,
          "en": "Now, regarding the files we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.34,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "the route jsx file is a very important file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "This is basically the route component that's always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "rendered no matter which route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 162.36,
          "en": "so which specific page is loaded thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "Now I'll get back to some of these components we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.46,
          "end": 166.35,
          "en": "in this file a little bit later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.35,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "but essentially that's the skeleton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 169.59,
          "en": "the wrapper that's wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 169.59,
          "end": 172.23,
          "en": "around any page content that you will define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 172.23,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "for your different pages that make up this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "You can also set up some general metadata here though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 180.27,
          "en": "as you will learn later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.27,
          "end": 184.05,
          "en": "You can also customize this metadata for different pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 184.05,
          "end": 186.33,
          "en": "But that's essentially the skeleton that will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.33,
          "end": 189.75,
          "en": "for any page that makes up your overall application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.75,
          "end": 192.183,
          "en": "your overall full stack website here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 193.32,
          "end": 195.54,
          "en": "We then got two entry files here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 195.54,
          "end": 198.99,
          "en": "which essentially define the code that will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 198.99,
          "end": 201.96,
          "en": "for every request that reaches the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 201.96,
          "end": 203.73,
          "en": "And you can edit this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 203.73,
          "end": 207.15,
          "en": "if you wanna run some extra code for every incoming request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 207.15,
          "end": 210.57,
          "en": "But unless you have clear plans what you wanna do there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 210.57,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "you should stick to the default code you get out of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 218.34,
          "en": "And the entry client jsx file basically contains the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.34,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "the JavaScript code that's executed on the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 225.12,
          "en": "So in the browser, after the page was loaded there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 225.12,
          "end": 228.24,
          "en": "And here you should also basically keep the default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 228.24,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "which you see here, unless you know what you're doing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.78,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "So these files aren't too interesting for us right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "I will get back to route jsx later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 240.513,
          "en": "but for the moment let's take a closer look at these routes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
